# React frontend

- **Typing:** Strict TypeScript. Define interfaces/types for all API responses and props. No `any` types.
- **Architecture:** Keep API calls out of UI components. Create a dedicated API service layer (e.g., `src/services/api.ts`).
- **UI/UX:** Use Tailwind CSS. Handle loading states and error states gracefully in the UI.
- **Styling:** No inline styles. Use Tailwind classes or external CSS only (see `no-inline-styles`).
- Adhere strictly to ESLint rules.
